70/extras/73c7c87c54b47523ee3b38ada4988ae6.webm?t=1771851879\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2825570/extras/73c7c87c54b47523ee3b38ada4988ae6.mp4?t=1771851879\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diorama Maker is very much work in progress, help me make this game even better!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play the demo</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Share your feedback, suggestions, ideas, etc.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the Discord or Steam discussion forums</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you enjoy this demo,\u00a0please leave a review\u00a0\ud83e\udd72</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Share the game with your friends and favorite streamers</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thanks for your support!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sheyper</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tons of features to unleash your creativity:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Customize the scene's ambiance (day/night cycle,  fog, weather effects...)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add buildings, props, vehicles, etc.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Add posable characters  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Draw in 3D</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Add FX (fire, smoke, muzzle flashes, blood splatter...) </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Share your diorama online</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Support both VR and desktops </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Cross platform </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And more!</p></li></ul>","developers":["Sheyper"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2825570/75d154edd63b4aa5267207cc270312677d958145/header.jpg?t=1771851879","is_free":false,"linux_